@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 180

title RestroVibes - Reliability Scoring & Ratings

actor Client
actor Restaurateur
participant "Web Interface" as Web
participant "AppointmentController" as Appt
participant "RatingController" as Rating
participant "ScoringEngine" as Score
participant "Database" as DB

== Scoring Algorithm ==

note over Score,DB
  rawPenalty = (noShows x 0.7 + lateArrivals x 0.4
              + lateCancellations x 0.3 + overstays x 0.15)
              / totalBookings

  completionRatio = completed / total
  decay = min(completionRatio x 0.15, rawPenalty x 0.3)
  penaltyScore = max(0, rawPenalty - decay)

  Thresholds:
    0.00 - 0.15  -> "reliable"   (green)
    0.15 - 0.40  -> "at_risk"    (yellow)
    > 0.40       -> "flagged"    (red)
end note

== Calculate Penalty ==

Appt -> Score : recalculateUserPenalty(userId)
Score -> DB : SELECT status, COUNT(*)\nFROM booking_history\nGROUP BY status
DB --> Score : { noShows: 3, lateArrivals: 1,\ncompleted: 15, total: 22 }

Score -> Score : rawPenalty = (3x0.7 + 1x0.4\n+ 2x0.3 + 1x0.15) / 22\n= 0.148
Score -> Score : completionRatio = 15/22 = 0.682
Score -> Score : decay = min(0.102, 0.044) = 0.044
Score -> Score : penaltyScore = max(0, 0.104) = 0.104

Score -> DB : UPDATE penalty_score,\nreliability_status,\nis_flagged, cached counts
DB --> Score : Updated

== Restaurateur Views Client Risk ==

Restaurateur -> Web : View appointment details
Web -> Appt : GET /api/appointments/:id
Appt -> DB : Fetch appointment + client risk
DB --> Appt : { penalty_score, status,\nis_flagged, history }
Appt --> Web : { appointment, clientRisk }
Web --> Restaurateur : ClientRiskPopover\n(color-coded badge)

== Risk Profile Endpoint ==

Restaurateur -> Web : Get client risk profile
Web -> Appt : GET /api/appointments/client/:id/risk-profile
Appt -> DB : Fetch stats + history
DB --> Appt : Risk data
Appt -> Appt : Classify:\nhigh: flagged or > 0.4\nmedium: > 0.15\nlow: otherwise
Appt --> Web : { riskLevel, penaltyScore, history }
Web --> Restaurateur : Risk assessment

== Bidirectional Rating System ==

Client -> Web : Rate restaurant\n(1-5 stars + comment)
Web -> Rating : POST /api/ratings/\n{ appointmentId,\ntargetType: "restaurateur",\nscore, comment }
Rating -> DB : Verify appointment completed
Rating -> DB : Check unique constraint
Rating -> DB : INSERT INTO ratings
Rating -> DB : SELECT AVG(score)\nWHERE targetType = "restaurateur"
DB --> Rating : avg = 4.5, count = 12
Rating --> Web : 201 { average: 4.5 }

Restaurateur -> Web : Rate client\n(1-5 stars + comment)
Web -> Rating : POST /api/ratings/\n{ appointmentId,\ntargetType: "client",\nscore, comment }
Rating -> DB : Verify appointment completed
Rating -> DB : Check unique constraint
Rating -> DB : INSERT INTO ratings
Rating -> DB : SELECT AVG(score)\nWHERE targetType = "client"
DB --> Rating : avg = 4.2, count = 8
Rating --> Web : 201 { average: 4.2 }

note over Rating,DB
  Constraints:
  - One rating per appointment per direction
  - Score range: 1-5 stars
  - Only after appointment completed
  - Enforced by unique DB constraint
end note

== Admin: Backfill Penalties ==

Restaurateur -> Web : POST /api/appointments/admin/backfill-penalties
Web -> DB : SELECT clients
DB --> Web : All client records
loop Per client
    Web -> Score : recalculatePenalty(id)
    Score -> DB : Fetch + update
end
Web --> Restaurateur : 200 All recalculated

@enduml
